### List DevNet pay/claim markers
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/devnet-pay-markers

### Refuse intended pay marker without txSignature (expect 400)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/devnet-pay-markers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "kind": "pay",
  "walletPubkey": "DevNetWallet1111111111111111111111111111111",
  "amountUsdc": 25.00,
  "status": "intended",
  "intendedInstruction": "subscribe_academy",
  "note": "must be refused"
}

### Reject academy subscription paid without txSignature
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/academy-subscriptions/1/devnet-pay
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "walletPubkey": "DevNetWallet1111111111111111111111111111111"
}

### Reject pending claim DevNet marker on an unconfirmed/fake signature (must not mark claimed)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/pending-claims/1/devnet-claim
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "walletPubkey": "DevNetWallet1111111111111111111111111111111",
  "txSignature": "intended-sig-claim-smoke"
}

### Reject pending claim DevNet marker without txSignature
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/pending-claims/1/devnet-claim
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "walletPubkey": "DevNetWallet1111111111111111111111111111111"
}
